Dantherm Control (formerly HCH5 Control)
Copyright MRDonnii

The Dantherm Modbus support (custom_components/hch_passivelink/mk2.py) uses
the Dantherm Residential Modbus register map – register addresses, data types,
unit modes, alarm codes and the device-type model names – as documented by the
Tvalley71/dantherm Home Assistant integration:

  Dantherm integration for Home Assistant
  https://github.com/Tvalley71/dantherm
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No source files were copied; the map was re-implemented with the Python
standard library.
